n\n🍬 Gather gumballs from the gumball machine on the way down to your factory! Purchase different flavors to earn more money!\n\nCODES:\n➡️AMAZINGTYCOON - 2x money and 5 minutes of sugar rush!\n➡️YAY160K - 3x money and 15 minutes of sugar rush!\n\nBe sure to give it a 👍 and favorite for more EXCITING updates on the way!\n\nIf your gumballs are stuck in a spiral loop, hit the green button in front of your machine! This will remove all gumballs from your factory to clear all possible complications.\n\n💖 This idea was created thanks to the inspiration of Fruit Juice Tycoon: Remastered!","path":"/game/9976239895-gumball-factory-tycoon","slug":"9976239895-gumball-factory-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e87cf3cb20f1f9cdb5a7aa6cc7b9878e79358f759faa609cd118067a842445dc.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e8d94601825975a1a53a3522e7769eb9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":59,"visitor":133750866,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-08-26T07:23:02.417Z","creator":{"name":"rep rep's studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":135880624242201,"name":"Cut Trees","desc":"🪓 Welcome to Cut Trees!\n\n🪵 Cut wood to increase your power!\n🎁 Open chests for new and powerful tools!\n⚔️ Fight with your friends!\n\nHow to Play: Cut trees, collect chests, finish your run, open chests, and equip your new tools!\n\nChangelog:\n\nWorld 4\nSpinwheel\nExclusive Chest\nRemoved the tool equipping in the lobby\nAtmosphere effects added to world 2","path":"/game/135880624242201-cut-trees","slug":"135880624242201-cut-trees","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ef31944df6593356705a03b72974c50a7f342de0237811ddb3bfcce54225742d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-63c7ff8459e815a124868cbccc80e1f7/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":59,"visitor":80306986,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T18:23:57.164Z","creator":{"name":"BEEP GAMES","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":34,"freeCount":34,"keyCount":